        <div style="padding:12px 16px; background:rgba(87,207,196,0.06); border-radius:8px; border-left:3px solid rgba(87,207,196,0.3);">
          <strong style="font-size:0.85rem;">Right:</strong> "go-to-market strategy for three enterprise product launches"
        </div>
      </div>
